// 010.6: `Exists f: True` over an enumerable type warns with CHR028 because it ranges
// over every domain element rather than testing whether an instance of `f` holds.
//! expect-warning: CHR028

Fact member Identified by Alice, Bob
Fact flagged Identified by member
Predicate check-vacuous When (Exists flagged: True)
.

?check-vacuous().
?!flagged(Alice).
